      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Mullery O’Gara are delighted to present this beautifully maintained and extended detached family home, ideally positioned within an exclusive and peaceful cul-de-sac of similar detached residences just off Fortfield Road.\r\n\r\nBuilt circa 1990, this attractive brick-fronted home offers bright, well-proportioned accommodation throughout, featuring a superb extended open-plan kitchen, living and dining area designed for modern family living. The property is further enhanced by low-maintenance, well-planted front and rear gardens, off-street parking, two side entrances and a concrete-built outhouse.\r\n\r\nThe location is exceptionally convenient, within easy reach of local shops, bus routes, sports facilities and an excellent selection of highly regarded schools including St. Pius X, St. Joseph’s, Terenure College, Our Lady’s, Presentation, Templeogue College and St. Mary’s. The M50 motorway and Dublin City Centre are also readily accessible.\r\n\r\nThe accommodation briefly comprises a welcoming entrance hall with guest WC, a spacious living room with bay window and double doors opening to the dining room, which in turn enjoys access to the rear garden. To the rear of the property is an impressive open-plan kitchen, living and dining space, flooded with natural light and ideally suited to contemporary family life. A separate utility room provides additional storage and convenient side access.\r\n\r\nUpstairs, there are four generously proportioned bedrooms. The principal bedroom and second bedroom each benefit from their own en-suite shower room, while a well-appointed family bathroom serves the remaining bedrooms.\r\n\r\nOutside, the property enjoys off-street parking to the front and a private, secluded rear garden with patio area, concrete-built outhouse and two side entrances.\r\n\r\nThis is a rare opportunity to acquire an exceptional detached family residence presented in impeccable turnkey condition. Nestled within an exclusive enclave of mature, tree-lined homes, the property enjoys a wonderful sense of privacy and tranquillity while benefiting from an unrivalled level of convenience, with every amenity imaginable on its doorstep.\r\n\r\nBeautifully maintained and finished to an exacting standard, this outstanding home offers spacious, light-filled accommodation and a superbly designed family-friendly layout, perfectly suited to modern living. Set within a quiet and prestigious cul-de-sac, the property combines generous reception space, excellent practicality and an enviable lifestyle setting.\r\n\r\nRenowned schools, recreational facilities, shopping destinations and excellent transport links are all within easy reach, ensuring everyday convenience without compromising on peace and seclusion. Rarely do homes of this calibre come to the market, making this a truly exceptional offering that is certain to appeal to discerning purchasers seeking quality, comfort and location in equal measure."
      },
